{"id":"predchuvstvie","lemma":"предчувствие","pos":"noun","rank":2470,"glosses":["foreboding, foreshadowing, presentiment, hunch (a premonition; a feeling that something, often of undesirable nature, is going to happen)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4a/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%87%D1%83%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%87%D1%83%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"предчувствия","plural":"предчувствия"},"examples":[{"text":"Это было всего лишь предчувствие.","en":"It was just a hunch.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"only, no more than"]]},{"text":"У меня плохое предчувствие насчёт этого.","en":"I've got a bad feeling about this.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"bad","l":"плохой"},null,{"g":"about"},null]},{"text":"Моё предчувствие подтвердилось.","en":"My premonition turned out to be right.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null,null]},{"text":"Это всего лишь предчувствие.","en":"It's just a hunch.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"only, no more than"]]},{"text":"У меня было предчувствие, что что-то не так.","en":"I had a premonition that something wasn't right.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"that"},null,null],"phrases":[[7,9,"wrong"]]}]}